      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "STINGER DRAW (3) was a course and distance placegetter (30.09) last time also from the same draw, finishing a 1.5 lengths second in a Novice race. Tough to beat on best. REGINALD BARKLEY (7) goes very well at the course and distance with two wins and a placing from three starts. Recorded a 6 length win (29.94) in a Novice race last time at this track. Looks suited here and can measure up. GIDEON MONELLI (8) missed the frame latest when fifth at this track (30.16) but was a winner three back in the best time of the program. Returns to favourable track. Form from his last run is proving strong. Key runner on best form. WEST ON PASH (2) profiles nicely here at this trip.",
